<title>UK: Aegon sets 300 mln guilder perpetual bond, call.</title>
<headline>Aegon sets 300 mln guilder perpetual bond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AEGON</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON    *7.25	MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.50    PAY DATE    14.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.25     SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS AND THEN EVERY 10 YEARS.</p>
<p>		IF CALL NOT EXERCISED THE COUPON WILL BE RESET AT</p>
<p>		HIGHER OF EXISTING RATE OR ONE TO YIELD 85 BP OVER</p>
<p>		10-YEARS DSL.</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-     DENOMS (K) 5-10-100-1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.25 PCT DSL DUE SEPTEMBER 2007</p>
<p>			    7.50 PCT DSL DUE APRIL 2010</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
